IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BEODCHK.

*> EOD batch checkpoint store (GATE 4).  One record per business date in
*> var/data/eodchk.idx.  Operational control data only: marks which EOD
*> stages completed, so a re-run can skip them and never double-apply
*> effects that are already persisted.  No financial truth lives here.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT CHK-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-CHK-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
        ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
        RECORD KEY IS EC-BD OF CHK-REC
        FILE STATUS IS WS-CHK-ST.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD CHK-FILE.
01 CHK-REC.
   COPY "BKEODC".

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-CHK-PATH PIC X(200).
01 WS-HOME PIC X(80).
01 WS-CHK-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-NOW PIC X(14).
01 WS-I PIC 9(02).
01 WS-EOF PIC X(01).

LINKAGE SECTION.
COPY "BKEODCP".
01 BK-EODCHK-DATA.
   COPY "BKEODC".

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BK-EODCHK-PARM BK-EODCHK-DATA.
    MOVE "00" TO EC-RC
    MOVE SPACES TO EC-MSG
    ACCEPT WS-HOME FROM ENVIRONMENT "BANK_HOME"
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-CHK-PATH
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/var/data/eodchk.idx"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-CHK-PATH
    OPEN I-O CHK-FILE
    IF WS-CHK-ST = "35"
        OPEN OUTPUT CHK-FILE
        CLOSE CHK-FILE
        OPEN I-O CHK-FILE
    END-IF
    IF WS-CHK-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE WS-CHK-ST TO EC-RC
        MOVE "CANNOT OPEN EOD CHECKPOINT" TO EC-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-NOW
    EVALUATE FUNCTION TRIM(EC-OP)
        WHEN "INIT" PERFORM DO-INIT
        WHEN "STAGE" PERFORM DO-STAGE
        WHEN "FINISH" PERFORM DO-FINISH
        WHEN "GET" PERFORM DO-GET
        WHEN "LIST" PERFORM DO-LIST
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE "99" TO EC-RC
            MOVE "UNKNOWN CHECKPOINT OP" TO EC-MSG
    END-EVALUATE
    CLOSE CHK-FILE
    GOBACK.

DO-INIT.
    MOVE EC-BIZDATE TO EC-BD OF BK-EODCHK-DATA
    MOVE "RUNNING" TO EC-ST OF BK-EODCHK-DATA
    MOVE SPACES TO EC-CUR OF BK-EODCHK-DATA
        EC-LAST OF BK-EODCHK-DATA
    MOVE "00" TO EC-RUN-RC OF BK-EODCHK-DATA
    MOVE WS-NOW TO EC-STARTED OF BK-EODCHK-DATA
        EC-UPDATED OF BK-EODCHK-DATA
    MOVE EC-OPERATOR TO EC-OPER OF BK-EODCHK-DATA
    MOVE EC-REQ OF BK-EODCHK-PARM TO EC-REQ OF BK-EODCHK-DATA
    PERFORM CLEAR-STAGES
    MOVE EC-BD OF BK-EODCHK-DATA TO EC-BD OF CHK-REC
    READ CHK-FILE
        INVALID KEY
            WRITE CHK-REC FROM BK-EODCHK-DATA
        NOT INVALID KEY
            REWRITE CHK-REC FROM BK-EODCHK-DATA
    END-READ.

DO-STAGE.
    MOVE EC-BIZDATE TO EC-BD OF CHK-REC
    READ CHK-FILE
        INVALID KEY
            MOVE "20" TO EC-RC
            MOVE "NO EOD CHECKPOINT FOR DATE" TO EC-MSG
        NOT INVALID KEY
            PERFORM SET-STAGE
            MOVE EC-CUR-STAGE TO EC-LAST OF CHK-REC
            MOVE WS-NOW TO EC-UPDATED OF CHK-REC
            REWRITE CHK-REC
            MOVE EC-LAST OF CHK-REC TO EC-LAST-STAGE
    END-READ.

DO-FINISH.
    MOVE EC-BIZDATE TO EC-BD OF CHK-REC
    READ CHK-FILE
        INVALID KEY
            MOVE "20" TO EC-RC
            MOVE "NO EOD CHECKPOINT FOR DATE" TO EC-MSG
        NOT INVALID KEY
            IF EC-STATE = "OK"
                MOVE "DONE" TO EC-ST OF CHK-REC
                MOVE "00" TO EC-RUN-RC OF CHK-REC
            ELSE
                MOVE "FAILED" TO EC-ST OF CHK-REC
                MOVE EC-RC TO EC-RUN-RC OF CHK-REC
            END-IF
            MOVE WS-NOW TO EC-UPDATED OF CHK-REC
            REWRITE CHK-REC
            MOVE "EOD CHECKPOINT CLOSED" TO EC-MSG
    END-READ.

DO-GET.
    MOVE EC-BIZDATE TO EC-BD OF CHK-REC
    READ CHK-FILE
        INVALID KEY
            MOVE "22" TO EC-RC
            MOVE "NO EOD CHECKPOINT FOR DATE" TO EC-MSG
        NOT INVALID KEY
            MOVE CHK-REC TO BK-EODCHK-DATA
            MOVE EC-ST OF CHK-REC TO EC-STATE
            MOVE EC-LAST OF CHK-REC TO EC-LAST-STAGE
            MOVE "CHECKPOINT LOADED" TO EC-MSG
    END-READ.

DO-LIST.
    MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = "Y"
        READ CHK-FILE NEXT RECORD
            AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
            NOT AT END
                DISPLAY "EODCHK " EC-BD OF CHK-REC " "
                    FUNCTION TRIM(EC-ST OF CHK-REC) " last="
                    FUNCTION TRIM(EC-LAST OF CHK-REC) " rc="
                    EC-RUN-RC OF CHK-REC " upd="
                    EC-UPDATED OF CHK-REC
        END-READ
    END-PERFORM.

CLEAR-STAGES.
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1
        UNTIL WS-I > 30
        MOVE "N" TO EC-STG OF BK-EODCHK-DATA (WS-I)
    END-PERFORM.

SET-STAGE.
    MOVE EC-STAGE-NO TO WS-I
    IF WS-I < 1 OR WS-I > 30
        MOVE "20" TO EC-RC
        MOVE "STAGE NUMBER OUT OF RANGE" TO EC-MSG
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE EC-CUR-STAGE TO EC-CUR OF CHK-REC
    MOVE "Y" TO EC-STG OF CHK-REC (WS-I).
